{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Kona 是一款整合寵物健康、訓練與生活記錄的應用程式，適合新養幼犬、照顧年長寵物或需要與家人分擔照顧責任的飼主。目前<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99，可把握機會下載。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-126.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>集中管理寵物健康與訓練</h2>\n<p>Kona 集中管理疫苗、藥物與補充品提醒，並保存獸醫就診、文件及可匯出 PDF 健康報告。訓練功能提供計劃與進度追蹤，也可記錄行為觀察以掌握變化。另設相片與里程碑時間軸，讓家人或寵物保母共同查看共享紀錄、提醒與更新；日常照顧疑問可向 Kona 查詢即時解答。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-119-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-120-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-121-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-122-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-123-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-124-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Kona – Pet Training &amp; Health</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/kona-pet-training-health/id6771674717?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.553337+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":300,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T18:37:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:37:25.478490+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:42.934272+00:00","content_hash":"e719455365cf647f113026175d9f5a7c653f5b66ae351b4a128b5492a2ba35e5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}